# The build context is the source, not the working tree.
#
# `target/` is the big one: 40+ GB of local build artefacts that would be uploaded to the daemon and then
# ignored, and whose presence also lets a stale local binary shadow a fresh build if a COPY ever widens.
target/
web/node_modules/
web/.svelte-kit/
web/build/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
data/
.git/
.github/
.mise.toml
.cargo/
*.log
